@startuml
title Level 2 DFD - 3.0 Execute Command (Redis-like Server)

actor "2 Dispatch" as Dispatcher

rectangle "3.1 Strings\nSET GET MSET MGET APPEND STRLEN\nINCR DECR INCRBY DECRBY" as Strings
rectangle "3.2 Lists\nLPUSH RPUSH LPOP RPOP\nLLEN LRANGE LINDEX" as Lists
rectangle "3.3 Hashes\nHSET HGET HMGET HDEL\nHGETALL HLEN HEXISTS" as Hashes
rectangle "3.4 Sets\nSADD SREM SCARD SMEMBERS\nSISMEMBER SINTER SPOP" as Sets
rectangle "3.5 Keyspace\nDEL EXISTS KEYS TYPE TTL PTTL\nPERSIST FLUSHDB DBSIZE" as Keys
rectangle "3.6 Server\nPING ECHO INFO CONFIG SAVE\nBGSAVE LASTSAVE BGREWRITEAOF" as ServerCmds

database "D1: Keyspace" as Store
database "D3: appendonlydir/" as Aof
database "D2: dump.snap" as Snapshot
database "D4: Stats" as Stats

Dispatcher --> Strings
Dispatcher --> Lists
Dispatcher --> Hashes
Dispatcher --> Sets
Dispatcher --> Keys
Dispatcher --> ServerCmds

Strings --> Store : find_string
Lists --> Store : find_as<List>,\nfind_or_create<List>
Hashes --> Store : find_as<Hash>,\nfind_or_create<Hash>
Sets --> Store : find_as<Set>,\nfind_or_create<Set>
Keys --> Store : lookup, delete, expiry
Store --> Dispatcher : value, nil or WRONGTYPE\n(as a RESP reply)

Strings --> Aof : writes, as executed\n(SET with EX/PX logged as PXAT)
Lists --> Aof : writes
Hashes --> Aof : writes
Sets --> Aof : writes
Keys --> Aof : writes

ServerCmds --> Snapshot : SAVE, BGSAVE
ServerCmds --> Aof : BGREWRITEAOF
ServerCmds --> Stats : INFO reads it

note bottom of Store
  A typed lookup of a key holding another
  type returns WRONGTYPE, never the value.
end note

@enduml
